TTOM WATCH", "label": "NEARING A LOW", "action": "GET READY", "dir": "down", "score": 6, "why": "Day 65 of a typical 36-42-day cycle \u2014 inside the window where lows usually form. No confirmed turn yet. Last cycle was left-translated (topped early) \u2014 a bearish structural tell.", "next": "Wait for the turn: a move above the low candle's high, then a close back above the 10-day average.", "weekly_ok": false, "regime": "bear", "regime_label": "BEARISH", "regime_why": "weekly momentum negative; investor cycle overdue; last cycle left-translated (topped early)", "regime_score": -4.0, "regime_line": "Bigger picture: BEARISH \u2014 weekly momentum negative; investor cycle overdue; last cycle left-translated (topped early) (investor cycle week 28 \u00b7 daily cycle day 65).", "summary_line": "Short-term (daily): nearing a low. Bigger picture (counter-trend): bearish.", "synthesis_line": "", "synthesis_line_zh": "", "points": ["Bigger picture is bearish (counter-trend for a daily long)", "Macro: US net liquidity neutral \u2014 no macro tilt on the odds", "Swing low printed (buyers rejected the low)", "Still below the 10-day average", "Prior cycle topped early (a tiring-trend hint)"], "entry": {"tag": "WATCH", "tag_zh": "\u89c2\u5bdf", "urgency": "soon", "days_lo": 0, "days_hi": 2, "text": "A cycle low is due in roughly ~0\u20132 trading days \u2014 watch for the turn, don't front-run it.", "text_zh": "\u5468\u671f\u4f4e\u70b9\u9884\u8ba1\u5728\u7ea6 ~0\u20132 \u4e2a\u4ea4\u6613\u65e5\u5185\u51fa\u73b0\u2014\u2014\u7b49\u5f85\u8f6c\u5411\uff0c\u5207\u52ff\u62a2\u8dd1\u3002"}, "cycle_plain": {"daily_line": "Daily cycle: day 65 of a typical 36\u201342 trading days", "daily_phase": "overdue \u2014 past the typical window, so a low could form any day", "daily_line_zh": "\u65e5\u7ebf\u5468\u671f\uff1a\u7b2c 65 \u5929\uff0c\u5178\u578b\u5468\u671f\u4e3a 36\u201342 \u4e2a\u4ea4\u6613\u65e5", "daily_phase_zh": "\u903e\u671f\u2014\u2014\u5df2\u8d85\u8fc7\u5178\u578b\u7a97\u53e